{"2026.3.9:P10-Q16":{"html":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"zh-CN\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>铜阳极泥金银铂回收及胆矾热重</title><!--chem-style:3f988976c5a5937e0558eab589702caac8cb68489be57106907d457df806601d--></head><body><main><a class=\"back\" href=\"../../../%E9%98%85%E8%AF%BB%E5%85%A5%E5%8F%A3.html\">← 返回题库</a><div class=\"eyebrow\">2026.3.9 · 雅礼高三下开学考 · 原题16 · P10-Q16</div><h1>铜阳极泥金银铂回收及胆矾热重</h1><div class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag main-tag\">主类别：化学实验基础/物质的分离、提纯</span></div><p class=\"rationale\">分类依据：分析电势酸度、反萃与晶胞结构。</p><details><summary>相关知识点</summary><div class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag\">物质结构与性质/原子结构与性质/基态原子的核外电子排布原则</span><span class=\"tag\">认识化学科学/氧化还原反应/氧化还原反应的应用/氧化还原反应方程式的书写与配平</span><span class=\"tag\">物质结构与性质/分子结构与性质/配合物</span><span class=\"tag\">物质结构与性质/晶体结构与性质/晶体常识</span><span class=\"tag\">化学反应原理/化学反应的热效应/反应热</span></div></details><details><summary>综合题小问分类</summary><ul class=\"subtopics\"><li><b>(1)</b> 银价层电子排布<small>物质结构与性质/原子结构与性质/基态原子的核外电子排布原则</small></li><li><b>(2)</b> 金酸溶电势与离子方程式<small>认识化学科学/氧化还原反应/氧化剂 还原剂/氧化性、还原性强弱的比较；化学反应原理/水的电离及溶液的酸碱性/溶液的酸碱性与pH；认识化学科学/离子反应/离子反应及离子方程式/离子方程式的书写</small></li><li><b>(3)</b> 酸性反萃剂<small>物质结构与性质/分子结构与性质/配合物；化学实验基础/物质的分离、提纯</small></li><li><b>(4)</b> 甲醛还原的计量<small>认识化学科学/氧化还原反应/氧化还原反应的应用/氧化还原反应有关计算</small></li><li><b>(5)①</b> 胆矾配位水热分解<small>化学反应原理/化学反应的热效应/反应热；物质结构与性质/分子结构与性质/配合物</small></li><li><b>(5)②</b> 铜稳定电子结构与高温价态<small>物质结构与性质/原子结构与性质/基态原子的核外电子排布原则</small></li><li><b>(6)</b> 铂晶胞参数<small>物质结构与性质/晶体结构与性质/晶体常识</small></li></ul></details><div class=\"card original\"><details><summary>展开原题题干与配图</summary><div><p>可能用到的相对原子质量：H~1  B~11  C~12  N~14  O~16  Na~23  S~32  Fe~56  Cu~64  Pt~195</p><p>16. 对电解精炼铜阳极泥(主要含Cu、Ag、Pt、Au等元素)进行回收的工艺流程如下：</p><p><img src=\"chem-asset:075d47a462608990c8b2d426abcc7256bf548f0fb33074be4680f9e0b9e452c3:0;\" style=\"width:457.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>（1）Ag与Cu同族，且位于Cu的下一周期，则基态Ag的价层电子排布式为_______。</p><p>（2）“酸浸”时，Pt、Au转化为<img src=\"chem-asset:b6f263b9c68cf8f3b5fa5ed5e044d18a9551d61d45ed10c29b34c71d59a82856:1;\" style=\"width:61.33px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">和<img src=\"chem-asset:163ce92aada53bf65922af54212abb15ae2a3f36f5f3bdcc895b0dfb7eee038e:2;\" style=\"width:60.40px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">。<img src=\"chem-asset:262b22592fc50c3dce6fe3ec57f731ceced95e4920c822b24b3dd3790f15655b:3;\" style=\"width:104.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">系的电势<img src=\"chem-asset:4a6d26eb0defe0ee07d6c3885d361e70074ab0e82b0eed7caf4bc2d0abc878ec:4;\" style=\"width:60.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">曲线如图，调节<img src=\"chem-asset:e5f08b348129b61a269323e3caf64fd036291b1477009309c4a3e332e03eedc8:5;\" style=\"width:61.13px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，pH范围为_______，使金溶解。此过程中，生成<img src=\"chem-asset:b6f263b9c68cf8f3b5fa5ed5e044d18a9551d61d45ed10c29b34c71d59a82856:1;\" style=\"width:61.33px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">的离子方程式为_______。</p><p><img src=\"chem-asset:e895e0d54d28442296039bb83a66f388af1b19b3ae3557f30abc2f53b752c7c5:6;\" style=\"width:186.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>（3）“萃铜”时发生反应<img src=\"chem-asset:cb92ea6fb3ea628bee4558f56eb04bade37fc9726f2f7fe7c1a415fbba35f482:7;\" style=\"width:268.20px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，则“反萃”时，反萃剂可选用_______。</p><p>（4）“还原”时，理论上消耗HCHO与<img src=\"chem-asset:a04a9ebd63a8b860a001013c26d03152ac180115ddce348da16c2f170766e188:8;\" style=\"width:88.80px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">的物质的量之比为_______。</p><p>（5）2.5 g胆矾(<img src=\"chem-asset:49bcdb63fe3575514df051e83ea7766f2509e6183818b970f93993dbe3383f3a:9;\" style=\"width:96.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">)受热分解过程的热重曲线(样品质量随温度变化的曲线)和胆矾结构如图所示：</p><p><img src=\"chem-asset:6e6f4e090169479e46c7b0840768d1e1b688d38ff81d2b632ca086f2a4b868a5:10;\" style=\"width:448.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>①请用化学方程式解释258℃时，胆矾晶体减重的原因：_______。</p><p>②请从原子结构角度解释，温度高于1000℃时发生反应的原因可能是_______。</p><p>（6）Pt晶胞结构如图所示，晶胞密度为<img src=\"chem-asset:9ad70ea10132fc05987f869630ec0e923c76d2111e57cf6f94f318fc781a0211:11;\" style=\"width:52.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，则晶胞参数为_______nm(N<sub>A</sub>为阿伏加德罗常数的值)。</p><p><img src=\"chem-asset:903addfacb23e3b46ff0cfa7ae1d311bdd0cd81dabae90462321987e46ce6445:12;\" style=\"width:163.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p></div></details><h2>原答案</h2><div class=\"answers\"><p>【答案】（1）<img src=\"chem-asset:6991379b62dd545dd25ba8399b5738d55754ecfa4b92fd5f816db5ad74210028:13;\" style=\"width:49.53px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">    </p><p>（2）    ①. <img src=\"chem-asset:65a9d716e534921edcf661eb375c72ea9ceea478e87eeac06714bb89b8474447:14;\" style=\"width:59.93px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">    ②. <img src=\"chem-asset:8868345a2d1f65ebffd726a7f95d2c2257bb3806d37c1b53d3be75b089587888:15;\" style=\"width:289.73px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">    </p><p>（3）稀硫酸或稀<img src=\"chem-asset:aad1c7653a3a3edda2d8b1be4bb810421e5cf6f94ab1265aaf8e6f2a5e152334:16;\" style=\"width:48.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">    </p><p>（4）1:2    （5）    ①. <img src=\"chem-asset:df0e15ebb790d6bdcd63df31e54e7e3e160a67b7e3c3d8bf23db09e3f89ac7bc:17;\" style=\"width:219.93px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">    ②. CuO中<img src=\"chem-asset:d50d784048dc4c6a2c0ca498ff5f7baeac5aaa79d2cc9be824f25c85934985ed:18;\" style=\"width:34.67px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">价电子排布为<img src=\"chem-asset:eb5081cc47cf7e6c0b36927ab58d0b282a6cba17f5dc92b05eea574109cba81f:19;\" style=\"width:25.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，<img src=\"chem-asset:6002d7015809d896f8182060a847b53f5b4791ec895f1dccb69d3febf0d18237:20;\" style=\"width:41.33px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">中<img src=\"chem-asset:d25438cfe94198207e8f6ab0a84c95b1fcc6c4875cfa464a38bd2429ebf006bd:21;\" style=\"width:31.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">价电子为全充满<img src=\"chem-asset:a2949b9d513a3c659259f40ac1975ec3ad50a15ff369afc8599ed7282c501659:22;\" style=\"width:29.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">的稳定结构    </p><p>（6）<img src=\"chem-asset:eec543216e677d127bf69d36626be657f70d8e00abf802a88e172fe5158b2841:23;\" style=\"width:82.87px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p></div><h2>原解析</h2><div class=\"analysis\"><p>【解析】</p><p>【分析】阳极泥(主要含Cu、Ag、Pt、Au等元素)加入<img src=\"chem-asset:aad1c7653a3a3edda2d8b1be4bb810421e5cf6f94ab1265aaf8e6f2a5e152334:24;\" style=\"width:48.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">、<img src=\"chem-asset:7d0049f04c619dbff6c77add34f7f4d40eeef9c6c28ac4d03d4b8bf54fa31a17:25;\" style=\"width:39.87px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">氧化酸浸，滤液1中含<img src=\"chem-asset:68c724590bdcdfcbf6d280c88079a0c6a672bdadd4b98d966a35addd92e2f779:26;\" style=\"width:35.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，Ag、Au、Pt不溶进入滤渣1，滤液1加入萃取剂萃取铜，再经过反萃取得到<img src=\"chem-asset:bf1aed82ef10df2ffe2db3a34ae024b72d56badb0b98b5039cef3271926dd9bd:27;\" style=\"width:49.33px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">溶液，经过一系列操作得到胆矾晶体，滤渣1加入HCl、H<sub>2</sub>O<sub>2</sub>，得到滤渣2为AgCl，经过浸取得到<img src=\"chem-asset:ab2e424f3200bd6e060a98a2304db366ea342d611c8d1169bd077d366bfc9507:28;\" style=\"width:97.47px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，在加入甲醛还原得到Ag，滤液2含有<img src=\"chem-asset:b6f263b9c68cf8f3b5fa5ed5e044d18a9551d61d45ed10c29b34c71d59a82856:1;\" style=\"width:61.33px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">和<img src=\"chem-asset:163ce92aada53bf65922af54212abb15ae2a3f36f5f3bdcc895b0dfb7eee038e:2;\" style=\"width:60.40px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，经过一系列操作回收Au、Pt，据此解答。</p><p>【小问1详解】</p><p> Ag为第五周期IB族元素，与Cu位于同一个副族，因此基态Ag价层电子排布为<img src=\"chem-asset:a33d42ae9357df55ad889ce6bc6b2c7790307b92acff8f8bdd3264d0c30625e1:29;\" style=\"width:49.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">。 </p><p>【小问2详解】</p><p>由电势-pH图，<img src=\"chem-asset:e5f08b348129b61a269323e3caf64fd036291b1477009309c4a3e332e03eedc8:30;\" style=\"width:61.13px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">时，仅当<img src=\"chem-asset:6871b4ed6802b413bff0f5af91ddff4af46a5dbb12486746f976f637f4855e34:31;\" style=\"width:64.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">时Au转化为<img src=\"chem-asset:163ce92aada53bf65922af54212abb15ae2a3f36f5f3bdcc895b0dfb7eee038e:32;\" style=\"width:61.13px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">（金溶解）；酸浸时<img src=\"chem-asset:7d0049f04c619dbff6c77add34f7f4d40eeef9c6c28ac4d03d4b8bf54fa31a17:33;\" style=\"width:40.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">作氧化剂氧化Pt，HCl提供氯离子生成<img src=\"chem-asset:b6f263b9c68cf8f3b5fa5ed5e044d18a9551d61d45ed10c29b34c71d59a82856:34;\" style=\"width:60.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，配平得到离子方程式<img src=\"chem-asset:a3e1c5ee0913861deac8bb456660e962d1d21e079ddaa6f4f0049863b4f123db:35;\" style=\"width:290.87px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">。</p><p>【小问3详解】</p><p> 萃取平衡<img src=\"chem-asset:76cef2aefc7ff136bf12ebe1702b749a4265be912186e3de66762482f6b2bb20:36;\" style=\"width:268.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，反萃需要使平衡逆向移动，提高<img src=\"chem-asset:087eb0c4f7f11973b2c2a4cfa0386f7b58fd2b127705847be9ec55c935fb7af3:37;\" style=\"width:42.87px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">即可，因此选稀硫酸。</p><p>【小问4详解】</p><p>还原反应中，HCHO中C为0价，被氧化为<img src=\"chem-asset:79e136d5164e6c72c317f91c9e914dbef264dd0c48658f668feb19681b4304b1:38;\" style=\"width:69.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">中+2价C，1mol HCHO失2mol电子；<img src=\"chem-asset:6511b084e7c4dd37914e909d6eaf025c218db7eeb92572fdbfd63933b4361959:39;\" style=\"width:88.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">中Ag为+1价，被还原为Ag，1mol <img src=\"chem-asset:6511b084e7c4dd37914e909d6eaf025c218db7eeb92572fdbfd63933b4361959:39;\" style=\"width:88.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">得1mol电子，由电子守恒得<img src=\"chem-asset:99b27b138969e11883404f6568baa40cd13a5973a5a9996f7342b25158b6b545:40;\" style=\"width:222.87px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">。 </p><p>【小问5详解】</p><p>① 2.5g胆矾（<img src=\"chem-asset:49bcdb63fe3575514df051e83ea7766f2509e6183818b970f93993dbe3383f3a:41;\" style=\"width:96.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，摩尔质量250g/mol）物质的量为0.01mol，113℃时，固体质量变为1.78g，失去结晶水的质量m = 2.50g - 1.78g = 0.72g，物质的量<img src=\"chem-asset:e2a7750f1735847c8d1e4d6865807584b03c61de7615096a602d657b2ca4c093:42;\" style=\"width:153.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，此时固体物质为<img src=\"chem-asset:94cd596ca87585f6f88a8f238802574b030b5ed0b483a61d5600e78f9dbef65b:43;\" style=\"width:88.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，258℃时剩余固体质量为1.60g，恰好等于0.01mol <img src=\"chem-asset:bf1aed82ef10df2ffe2db3a34ae024b72d56badb0b98b5039cef3271926dd9bd:44;\" style=\"width:49.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">的质量，说明胆矾完全失去结晶水，写出反应方程式为<img src=\"chem-asset:8b9794d064508d0908cf45b008246ada86a88c7c2b5b691576b42960ff15b4ce:45;\" style=\"width:220.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">。 </p><p>② <img src=\"chem-asset:56e75b919db890f4b094107d9aaf2e54a1b42a0279e7e0eb4cbb08d6a92241ed:46;\" style=\"width:50.40px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">时，固体质量由0.80g变为0.72g，<img src=\"chem-asset:a1b53eb7946b3b84640961a7e1259159ca0941bb8a1c855935a0e40562dc48d5:47;\" style=\"width:44.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">时0.80g固体为<img src=\"chem-asset:8d9b4c146a904a0a2d9aceec82b480ec9e541fbbeff5729569a18addd5cdd175:48;\" style=\"width:33.40px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">（0.01mol胆矾中Cu元素物质的量为0.01mol，若全转化为<img src=\"chem-asset:8d9b4c146a904a0a2d9aceec82b480ec9e541fbbeff5729569a18addd5cdd175:48;\" style=\"width:33.40px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，<img src=\"chem-asset:28fd1ac3c7c468e225f03baa1f2962174aad3504db7c4663db26d68157a5e9e1:49;\" style=\"width:209.60px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">），从<img src=\"chem-asset:8d9b4c146a904a0a2d9aceec82b480ec9e541fbbeff5729569a18addd5cdd175:48;\" style=\"width:33.40px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">变为0.72g固体，质量减少0.80g - 0.72g = 0.08g，这是O元素的质量，物质的量<img src=\"chem-asset:fea0e84f0906aea996623321499c87829fcbb51fb2d7b70962e33a284e578424:50;\" style=\"width:160.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，剩余O元素物质的量为0.01mol - 0.005mol = 0.005mol ，Cu与O物质的量之比为0.01mol:0.005mol = 2:1 ，此时固体为<img src=\"chem-asset:2a603a1873a1ef6f1645e7159c4132a3976b7a5f3aed7151e91a4041c0faeece:51;\" style=\"width:35.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，所以<img src=\"chem-asset:56e75b919db890f4b094107d9aaf2e54a1b42a0279e7e0eb4cbb08d6a92241ed:46;\" style=\"width:50.40px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">时发生反应的化学方程式为<img src=\"chem-asset:cc5005dea113b70ba12e74060dacd1953d886c84ab7593ee25eab9186cdfaceb:52;\" style=\"width:177.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">。从结构上看，CuO中<img src=\"chem-asset:d50d784048dc4c6a2c0ca498ff5f7baeac5aaa79d2cc9be824f25c85934985ed:18;\" style=\"width:34.67px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">价电子排布为<img src=\"chem-asset:eb5081cc47cf7e6c0b36927ab58d0b282a6cba17f5dc92b05eea574109cba81f:19;\" style=\"width:25.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，<img src=\"chem-asset:6002d7015809d896f8182060a847b53f5b4791ec895f1dccb69d3febf0d18237:20;\" style=\"width:41.33px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">中<img src=\"chem-asset:d25438cfe94198207e8f6ab0a84c95b1fcc6c4875cfa464a38bd2429ebf006bd:21;\" style=\"width:31.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">价电子为全充满<img src=\"chem-asset:a2949b9d513a3c659259f40ac1975ec3ad50a15ff369afc8599ed7282c501659:22;\" style=\"width:29.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，3d轨道全充满结构更稳定，因此高温下<img src=\"chem-asset:e41a569775b4a0c0010707d73be178f3f37a32456cfac52e3f173f7ba5596466:53;\" style=\"width:36.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">转化为更稳定的<img src=\"chem-asset:d25438cfe94198207e8f6ab0a84c95b1fcc6c4875cfa464a38bd2429ebf006bd:21;\" style=\"width:31.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">。</p><p>【小问6详解】</p><p>Pt晶胞为面心立方，晶胞中Pt原子数为<img src=\"chem-asset:ec910257ecadda071558d77f0363ab0b0c387c575897167444de5c1537ad5aa6:54;\" style=\"width:103.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，晶胞质量<img src=\"chem-asset:49063de85d9c8eeb43d47195739d9a13fd2041a09a1e4d729f3bde925317af2b:55;\" style=\"width:123.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，由密度公式<img src=\"chem-asset:65cfd263160c890508bb6e8ba20a11a4b10ff56d7ebe26ccce82470ffc90ce14:56;\" style=\"width:49.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">得<img src=\"chem-asset:67317d5f51182c0c6bc7ab209879e898d95b50041bad1911a967f8e379beaeed:57;\" style=\"width:129.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">。</p></div></div><p class=\"note\">原答案和解析按原内容保留，未逐题独立重解或校订。知识点及小问标签为本次整理标注。</p><details><summary>来源与核对</summary><p>D:\\高中化学\\01_资料层\\高中试卷\\2026.3.9\\精品解析：湖南长沙市雅礼中学2025-2026学年高三下学期开学化学试题\\精品解析：湖南长沙市雅礼中学2025-2026学年高三下学期开学化学试题（解析版）.docx</p><a href=\"file:///D:/%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6/01_%E8%B5%84%E6%96%99%E5%B1%82/%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD%E8%AF%95%E5%8D%B7/2026.3.9/%E7%B2%BE%E5%93%81%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%9A%E6%B9%96%E5%8D%97%E9%95%BF%E6%B2%99%E5%B8%82%E9%9B%85%E7%A4%BC%E4%B8%AD%E5%AD%A62025-2026%E5%AD%A6%E5%B9%B4%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%89%E4%B8%8B%E5%AD%A6%E6%9C%9F%E5%BC%80%E5%AD%A6%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98/%E7%B2%BE%E5%93%81%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%9A%E6%B9%96%E5%8D%97%E9%95%BF%E6%B2%99%E5%B8%82%E9%9B%85%E7%A4%BC%E4%B8%AD%E5%AD%A62025-2026%E5%AD%A6%E5%B9%B4%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%89%E4%B8%8B%E5%AD%A6%E6%9C%9F%E5%BC%80%E5%AD%A6%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%EF%BC%88%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E7%89%88%EF%BC%89.docx\">打开原来源文件</a></details></main></body></html>","assets":["075d47a462608990c8b2d426abcc7256bf548f0fb33074be4680f9e0b9e452c3","087eb0c4f7f11973b2c2a4cfa0386f7b58fd2b127705847be9ec55c935fb7af3","163ce92aada53bf65922af54212abb15ae2a3f36f5f3bdcc895b0dfb7eee038e","262b22592fc50c3dce6fe3ec57f731ceced95e4920c822b24b3dd3790f15655b","28fd1ac3c7c468e225f03baa1f2962174aad3504db7c4663db26d68157a5e9e1","2a603a1873a1ef6f1645e7159c4132a3976b7a5f3aed7151e91a4041c0faeece","49063de85d9c8eeb43d47195739d9a13fd2041a09a1e4d729f3bde925317af2b","49bcdb63fe3575514df051e83ea7766f2509e6183818b970f93993dbe3383f3a","4a6d26eb0defe0ee07d6c3885d361e70074ab0e82b0eed7caf4bc2d0abc878ec","56e75b919db890f4b094107d9aaf2e54a1b42a0279e7e0eb4cbb08d6a92241ed","6002d7015809d896f8182060a847b53f5b4791ec895f1dccb69d3febf0d18237","6511b084e7c4dd37914e909d6eaf025c218db7eeb92572fdbfd63933b4361959","65a9d716e534921edcf6